{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しお久しぶりです、、、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はですね、14時〜\nTBSテレビ系「超タッグ祭」の生放送に出させていただくのでその合間に書いています🖋️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お昼に更新するなんてなかなかないから新鮮！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobJXYwhO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日のお写真"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mob0W4dEk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MUSIC AWARDS JAPAN 2026\nエントリー発表会に登壇させて頂きました🖤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨年のレッドカーペットやグランドセレモニーに続いて今年もこうした形で関わることができてとても嬉しいです🔖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨年も思ったけれど、、\n改めて色んなアーティストの皆様がいらっしゃるなかで乃木坂46というグループを好きでいてくれて私たちの音楽を聴き続けてくれて本当に幸せな気持ちでいっぱいです😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/8ZQc-rUtzxU"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エントリー発表会の様子はこちらから観れます🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobF2XSxs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CREATEs presents IDOL RUNWAY\nCOLLECTION 2026 Supported by TGC"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初ランウェイ！\nリハーサル、信じられないくらい緊張していたけど本番は皆さんの声だったり推しメンタオルだったりに凄く助けられた！！😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなの力はとても偉大です\nありがとう😊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本番中の高揚感、忘れられないな〜、、\nまたいつか歩きたい！\n挑戦したい目標が一つできました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobukzV6o.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近のお気に入り私服\n今年の春はグレー買いがち✌🏻🩶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、そろそろ支度しなきゃ\n書きたいことありすぎるので、また書きますね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41stシングル\n「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVも22日0時に公開されます！\n楽しみに待ってて🪽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では！いってきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "超タッグ祭観てね〜〜🫶🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026.3.21"}], "source": "official"}